{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21929","headline":"废琴 · 白居易","name":"废琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丝桐合爲琴，中有太古声。\n古声澹无味，不称今人情。\n玉徽光彩灭，朱弦尘土生。\n废弃来已久，遗音尚泠泠。\n不辞爲君弹，纵弹人不听。\n何物使之然，羌笛与秦筝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}